OL,3,A'No place for violence', Macron says,
OL,4,Aas protesters clash with police in
OL,5,Acities across France
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere is "no place for violence",
OL,8,FFrench President Emmanuel Macron says,
OL,9,Fas protesters clash with police in
OL,10,FParis and other cities across France
OL,11,Fover falling education standards and
OL,12,Fthe cost of living
OL,14,FAbout 550,000 people have taken part in
OL,15,Fthe protests, according to Interior
OL,16,FMinister Laurent Nunez
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
