OL,3,A'No place for violence', Macron says,
OL,4,Aas protesters clash with police in
OL,5,Acities across France
OL,6,
OL,7,FNunez also says about 400 people have
OL,8,Fbeen arrested - a tourism office has
OL,9,Fbeen set on fire in Lyon, while
OL,10,Fprotesters have broken into and damaged
OL,11,Ftown hall buildings in Lille and
OL,12,FMarseille
OL,14,FIt follows three weeks of student-led
OL,15,Fprotests across the country, with calls
OL,16,Ffor students to be joined by workers'
OL,17,Funions and key figures from the
OL,18,Fso-called "yellow vest" movement
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
